Pailu
$cards
DECK 4 {SPADES, HEARTS}

$initial
DRAW 43 ROTATE 3 U 2
GEWO 2 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
GEWO 9 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
GEWO 8 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
GEWO 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
GEWO 5 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
GEWO 2 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
GEWO 2 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

EMU 5 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
EMU 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
EMU 10 FACE_ALL
EMU 7 FACE_ALL
